# Incident Response Checklist

## Purpose

Use this checklist to prepare for, detect, analyze, contain, eradicate, recover from, and review cybersecurity incidents.

## Scope

Phishing, malware, ransomware, unauthorized access, account compromise, data exposure, suspicious logins, and endpoint alerts.

